===== Upgrading OpenWrt =====

On Linksys dual partition routers, it is recommended to upgrade by reverting to the original Linksys firmware (either via three failed reboots or luci-app-advanced-reboot). After rebooting to the original firmware, follow the original installation instructions with the upgrade's 'factory' .bin. A sysupgrade image is provided, but it is **not recommended** for most users, as upgrading via sysupgrade will remove the original firmware from the router entirely, and restoring it is not supported.
